  "verseCount": 30,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "44",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JER 44"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "44",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amang’ana Nyasae atomerete Abaisraeli abarenge Misiri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ring’ana ri’Omonene rigacha ase Yeremia igoro y’Abayahudi bonsi bamenyete ase ense ya Misiri, agwo ase emechie ya Migidoli, na Tapenesi, na Memifisi, na ase orogongo rwa Patirosi, rigateba:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aya nar’Omonene bw’Emeganda, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, agoteeba: Inwe mwarorire amabe onsi narentete ase Yerusalemu, na ase emechie yonsi y’Abayuda. Nonya ngoika reero emechie eyio nigo esaregete, na onde tamenyeti aroro,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ekiagera abanto nigo bakorete ebibe, bakangechia, na inche nkaba nendamwamu ase bare, Barabwo nigo basambete ubani ase chinyasae ching’ao, naende bagachikorera. Chinyasae echio batamanyete, gose inwe timochimanyeti, nonya nechisokooro chiaino tichiachimanyete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Korende nonya naboigo, inche nigo nagendererete gotoma abasomba baane ababani kobateebia: Timobaisa gokora amang’ana ’okogechia aya inche Omonene ngechete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende abanto abwo tibaigwerete, gose gontegerera, erinde baonchoke korwa ase obobe, gose batige gosamba ubani ase chinyasae ching’ao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase engencho eyio nkarenta ekeririanda kiane na endamwamu yane ase emechie y’Abayuda ne chinchera chia Yerusalemu, na bikaba amaturi bitamenyiri, buna bire goika reero iga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bono aya nar’Omonene, Nyasae bw’Emeganda, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, agoteeba: Nase ki mogwekorera inwe abanyene obobe obo obonene? Nigo morigetie gosiria kegima abasacha na abakungu, na abana bakogonka, na abana bande, korwa ase Abayuda, na timotigaria nonya noyomo?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nase ki mokongechia nkoba nendamwamu ase engencho y’emeremo y’amaboko aino ase ogosamba ubani ase chinyasae ching’ao agwo ase ense ya Misiri momenyete? Inee! Nigo mogokora ayio ase ogwesiria kegima, erinde abanto b’ebisaku bionsi bi’ense baabachecherie na koragereria ase erieta riaino?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inee! Nigo mwebire obobe bwe chisokoro chiaino na obw’abarwoti b’Abayuda, na obw’abakungu babo, na obwaino, na obw’abakungu baino, obwo bwakoretwe ase ense y’Abayuda na ase chinchera chia Yerusalemu?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Goika rituko ria reero monto onde tari bwekeeirie ase okoba omoitongo, gose koiroka na kobwata amachiiko aane, na emeroberio nabegete ase amasio aino, na ase amasio e chisokoro chiaino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ase ayio, aya nar’Omonene bw’Emeganda, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli agoteeba: Naama! Nanachire ekiina, ase ebirengererio biane ng’a nimbarentere amaakwa na kobasiria inwe Abayuda bonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindusie abatigari b’Abayuda, abwo babekire ebirengererio biabo gochia komenya buna abamenyi ase ense ya Misiri, mbasirie bonsi pi. Mbakwere agwo ase ense ya Misiri ase ogoitwa nemioro na enchara. Ee, mbasirigwe ase ogoitwa nemioro na enchara, korwa omonto omoke goika omonene. Nababe bagokwanwa ekero abanto bakoragereria, na ekero abanto bakobarora nigo barakumie na goichana, naende babe bakoragererigwa na gochecherigwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindue egesusuro ase abanto bamenyete ase ense ya Misiri, buna nakorete ase abanto ba Yerusalemu; nimbasirie ase ogoitwa nemioro, na enchara, na oborwaire bogoita.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nonya nomonto oyomo ase abatigari b’Abayuda abwo bachete komenya ase ense ya Misiri tagotooreka, gose koirana gochia ase ense y’Abayuda, eyio baganetie bairane gochia komenyao. Tibakonyara koirana, otatiga abanto bake abaratooreke.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio abasacha bonsi abamanyete ng’a abakungu babo konya basambire ubani ase chinyasae ching’ao, amo nabakungu bonsi bateneine agwo, na omosangererekano omonene, na abanto bonsi abamenyete ase orogongo rwa Patirosi ase ense ya Misiri, bakairaneria Yeremia, bakamoteebia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Igoro y’amang’ana ayio gwakwanire ase tore ase erieta ri’Omonene, intwe titokoigwera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende intwe nigo togochia gokora buna twarire eira gokora. Tosambe ubani ase Eting’ana ya Igoro, naende toumore okoruegwa kw’ebinyugwa asere, buna twakorete intwe amo ne chisokoro chiaito, na abarwoti baito amo nabanene baito. Ayio nigo tware koyakora ase emechie y’Abayuda na ase chinchera chia Yerusalemu. Ekero keria nigo twabwate endagera enyinge, naende tokagenderera gosesenigwa, na titwanyoretwe namabe ande onsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende gese twatigete gosamba ubani na koumora okoruegwa kw’ebinyugwa ase Eting’ana ya Igoro, twabeire tokoremerwa kera egento, naende twabeire togosirigwa ase ogoitwa nemioro na enchara.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na abakungu bagateeba, “Ekero twasambete ubani na koumora okoruegwa gwaito gw’ekenyugwa ase Eting’ana ya Igoro, naende tokayeroiseria emegati yabekire omogwekano oye, abasacha baito nigo bancheranete nayio.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Yeremia akairaneria, agateebia abanto bonsi, abasacha na abakungu, abwo bonsi bakwanete amang’ana ayio, akabora,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Igoro ya ubani eria mwasambete agwo ase emechie y’Abayuda na ase chinchera chia Yerusalemu, inwe ne chisokoro chiano, na abarwoti baino, na abanene baino b’oborwoti, na abanto bonsi b’ense eyio, Inee, nigo mokagete ng’a Omonene tainyoreti amang’ana ayio onsi?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekeene, Omonene tare konyara koremereria nogokora kwaino okobe, na okogechia okwo mwakorete. Ase ayio ense yaino yasarigwe yabeire bosa, naende yaragererigwe, temenyiri na onde; naboigo ere goika reero iga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amabe aya nigo abanyorire goika rituko eri ria reero, ekiagera inwe mwasambete ubani, naende mogakora ebibe ase Omonene, gose timwamoigwerete gose kobwatia amachiiko aye, na emeroberio yaye echiikire, na oborori bwaye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende Yeremia agakwana nabaanto bonsi amo nabakungu bonsi, akabateebia, “Inwe Abayuda bonsi abamore ase ense ya Misiri, igwa ring’ana ri’Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya nar’Omonene bw’Emeganda, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, agoteeba: Inwe amo nabakungu baino mwakorire na goikerania namaboko aino ayio mwakwanete nemenwa yaino, mogateba: Goika tokore buna twariete eira gokora; tosambe ubani ase Eting’ana ya Igoro, naende toumore okoruegwa kw’ebinyugwa asere. Bono inwe kora bo, moikeranie chiira chiaino!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende inwe Abayuda mwensi momenyete ase ense ya Misiri, igwa ring’ana ri’Omonene! Ere nigo agoteeba iga: Naama! Netianirie ase erieta riane rinene ng’a, erieta erio tirigwatorwa nonya ng’ake naende nomonwa bw’Omoyuda onde bwensi aiga ase ense yonsi ya Misiri, atebe: Ekeene, buna Omonene are moyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rora, nigo mbarigereretie korwa igoro ase okobarentera amabe, gose tari amaya. Abayuda bonsi abare ase ense ya Misiri mbasirigwe ase ogoitwa nemioro, na enchara, goika baere kegima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaratooreke korwa ase emioro mbarue ase ense ya Misiri, bairane ase ense y’Abayuda, abanto abasinini mono ase omobaro. Abatigari bonsi b’Abayuda abagendete komenya ase ense ya Misiri nabamanye gose ring’ana neriang’o riragenderere koba eri’ekeene, eriane gose eriabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
