            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya nar’Omonene agoteeba: Nimbeke Farao Hofura, omorwoti o Misiri, ase amaboko ’ababisa baye, abwo bakorigia gosiria obogima bwaye, buna nabegete Zedekia, omorwoti bw’Abayuda, ase okoboko kwa Nebukadinesaro, omorwoti o Babiloni, oria orenge omobisa oye, na origetie komoita.”",
          "type": "text",
